+|---|---|
+| board shows 23 real sessions, 1 running, real spend | ✅ observed live |
+| steer → directive → consumed → `acknowledged=true` | ✅ observed live, session `pi:01a0b023b` |
+| approve/deny on claude-code → 422, not 502 | ✅ observed live |
