+D-LEDGER-4 "JIT / point of use, not 24h standing" -> REQ JIT-01/02.
+D-LEDGER-5 "Infinite configurability, no corset, enable/disable every axis"
+-> REQ ORCH-02 + CFG-01 (new, see §5c): every axis is a live toggle in one
