+GPT-OSS-120B / Poolside Laguna S 2.1 /
+Nanbeige4.1-3B / Gemma 4 26B / MiniMax M2.7 /
+Falcon-H1R (S3 §2, confirmed this session)    -> feed COST-03/ROUTE-02 model
+                                                  catalog once CFG-01 schema exists
