+<p>Measured properties: hash-chained (<code>prior_hash</code>, <code>payload_hash</code>); tamper detected (<code>verify_sigchain()</code> returned <code>False</code> after in-place mutation); frozen dataclass (<code>FrozenInstanceError</code> on assignment); gap reporting (<code>record_capture_gap</code>); replay (<code>replay(audit_id=...)</code>).</p>
